<p><em>Last updated: {% year %}</em></p>

<p>Social Circus is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</p>

<p>In practice, this means: some links on this Site — for example, product recommendations in our guides or tool pages — are affiliate links. If you click one of these links and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a small commission. This comes at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>; the price you pay is the same either way.</p>

<h2>How we choose what to recommend</h2>
<p>We only link to products that are directly relevant to the game, activity, or guide you're reading — party supplies, board and card games, and similar items. Affiliate status never determines whether something is recommended; it's simply how we may earn revenue on products we'd suggest anyway.</p>

<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>This Site may also display advertising through Google AdSense or similar ad networks. These ads are served by third parties and may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites — see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for opt-out details.</p>

<p>Questions about this disclosure? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
